      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This untitled poem by Sir Robert Grant was published posthumously by Robert’s brother Charles Grant (Lord Glenelg) as the third poem (“III”) in <tei:hi rend="italic">Sacred Poems by the Late Right Hon. Sir Robert Grant</tei:hi> (1839), pp. 9-11. It was first published without attribution as hymn No19 in the Appendix of <tei:hi rend="italic">Hymns for private devotion, selected and original</tei:hi> (ed. Bethia Fuller-Maitland, 1827) on pages 190-191. It was first attributed to Grant as hymn No12 in <tei:hi rend="italic">Psalms and Hymns for Public, Private, and Social Worship</tei:hi> (ed. Henry V. Elliott, 1835) on pages 63-64.</tei:p>
